        "content": "\u003ctool_output name=\"bash\" status=\"ok\" trust=\"untrusted\"\u003e\n=== build ===\n=== grep 'self' tests for channel Render in e2e ===\nspecs/session-scoped-config/check.md:40:- `internal/knowledge/knowledge.go`（新）：JSONL store + Render\nspecs/session-scoped-config/check.md:73:| TC-015~018 | `TestUpsertOverwriteByID`、`TestUpsertOverwriteSurvivesReopen`、`TestQueryFilters`、`TestDeleteRewriteIntegrity`、`TestRender` | `internal/knowledge` |\ndocs/troubleshooting/known-issues.md:253:  - 缓解：`ErrorBoundary` 现在会把这类错误原文显示出来（React 的 \"Rendered fewer hooks than expected\"），不再是白屏。\n\n\u003c/tool_output\u003e",
